OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786963675
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FAn Ebola outbreak in the Democratic
OL,7,FRepublic of Congo is now the deadliest
OL,8,Fin its history with at least 2,325
OL,9,Fpeople killed, according to government
OL,10,Fdata.
OL,12,FThe toll in Central Africa has already
OL,13,Fsurpassed the 2,299 lives claimed
OL,14,Fduring the virus's deadly spread in
OL,15,F2018 and 2020.
OL,17,FThe United Nation's humanitarian
OL,18,Faffairs chief Tom Fletcher said the
OL,19,Fepidemic was now killing one person
OL,20,Fevery 30 minutes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
