OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786963675
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FHe announced an additional $30.5
OL,7,Fmillion (#22.5 million) in emergency
OL,8,Ffunding to help tackle the outbreak.
OL,10,FWorld Health Organisation regional
OL,11,Fdirector for Africa, Dr Mohamed Yakub
OL,12,FJanabi, added: "We are chasing the
OL,13,Fvirus, the virus is ahead of us."
OL,15,FCongo's health ministry confirmed on
OL,16,FX, formerly Twitter, cases had risen
OL,17,Fto 4,945 on Sunday - including 101 new
OL,18,Fones detected in the previous 24 hours.
OL,26,@tD@POUuD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
