OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FAround 730 patients are in isolation,
OL,7,For hospitalised, and 1,040 people have
OL,8,Frecovered. The case fatality rate
OL,9,Fstands at 47 per cent.
OL,11,FThe province of Ituri remains the
OL,12,Fepicentre of the outbreak.
OL,14,FSymptoms of Ebola include fever,
OL,15,Fheadache and tiredness and, as it
OL,16,Fprogresses, vomiting and diarrhoea can
OL,17,Fdevelop, leading to organ failure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
