OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FIn communities across eastern Congo,
OL,7,Fhealth workers are searching for those
OL,8,Fexposed to suspected or confirmed
OL,9,Fcases in an attempt to get anyone
OL,10,Fshowing symptoms into care before the
OL,11,Fvirus spreads further.
OL,13,FBut those going door to door face
OL,14,Frisks of their own.
OL,16,FAna Ndroy Kasime, based in Nizi, said
OL,17,Fworkers like her lack basic protective
OL,18,Fequipment, such as boots and other
OL,19,Fsupplies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
