OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FMs Kasime told the Associated Press:
OL,7,F"We buy disinfectant with our own
OL,8,Fmoney."
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FThe current outbreak, caused by the
OL,16,Frare Bundibugyo Ebola virus, is
OL,17,Funfolding in some of the most
OL,18,Fchallenging conditions imaginable.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@GO]
