PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786963675
OL,3,CEbola outbreak in DR Congo now
OL,4,Cdeadliest in country's history
OL,6,FAt least a dozen attacks on health
OL,7,Ffacilities and workers were recorded
OL,8,Fas of mid-July, according to local
OL,9,Fhealth authorities.
OL,11,FIn one incident, locals stormed a
OL,12,Fhospital in Nyakunde and entered a
OL,13,Fnearby Ebola treatment centre, forcing
OL,14,Fpatients and staff to flee before
OL,15,Foperations resumed the following day.
OL,17,FMany residents' anger is caused by
OL,18,Fmisinformation about the virus and
OL,19,Fbans on traditional burials.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
